space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8Zp30uIic2SWz5m0NWbk47UHIC7FAKDgtv7oMI8Rcbwff0fgwvj1iaADrVtntDb1fP18S18zbGHibdA/0?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</strong>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         感谢客人出差带回的豆子，这是我们新尝试的一个烘焙厂牌\n        </p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         现在我们知道\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n<strong>\n            这个厂牌是由两个自行车赛车手组建的，偏中深的烘焙度\n           </strong>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         现在店里有的品项，\n        </p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Colombia\n           <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Rafael Aya La Virginia\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<em>\n             Caturra\n            </em>\n</span>\n           Washed 售完啦\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Ethiopia\n           <strong>\n            Gedeo\n           </strong>\n<strong>\n            Yirgacheffe\n           </strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             Bedhatu Jibicho\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Heirloom\n            </span>\n</em>\n           Natural 售完啦\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
